{"kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end_line": 13, "text": "关于打人问题（一九六六年八月一日）\n中文马克思主义文库\n->\n毛泽东\n->\n1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》\n199)\n关于打人问题\n（一九六六年八月一日）\n党的政策不主张打人。但打人也要进行阶级分析，好人打坏人活该；坏人打好人，好人光荣；好人打好人误会。今后再不许打人。要摆事实讲道理。\n上一页\n目录\n下一页\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-582a0830a9c35032bbea", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-199.htm", "source_raw_sha256": "4afd97a34c2090f7546bfcfda1353a3820667adf2b33dc297d13f135e0f573bd", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-1968", "volume": 5, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "dce63f3a3f158f99422ec65cb9ceee111050ce299270b5ca8c08da88ed2e83d2", "text_chars": 156}
